  "description": "I logged out, only to find myself in a ruined, otherworldly realm. Trapped inside the virtual reality game \\*Evil Tale\\*, Kim U-Jin repeatedly requested a identity verification, but the only responses he received were: \"Resident registration number does not exist,\" \"Company unknown/unheard of,\" and even his own beloved family were flagged as \"individuals of unverified identity.\" Just as security personnel arrived to \"take care\" of him, the \"Log Out\" button finally appeared! With trembling hands, he pressed it—and arrived in…\n\n*“...F\\*ck.”*\n\n...an entirely different world.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
